  "description": "T1. Lime Tree\t\r\n\r\nLocation: Rear Garden, Southeast Corner, next to neighbour’s garden room.\r\n\r\nMovement was detected at the base during tree works carried out earlier this year, indicating potential instability. This may be due to some of the roots being severed during the neighbour's fence installation.\r\nRecommendation: Pollarding the tree at 4m to reduce crown weight and mitigate the risk of structural failure.\r\n\r\nThe tree's current height is 7m, and its crown spread is 3m\r\nAfter the proposed works, the tree's height is 4m and the crown spread is 2m",
